Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:40:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix plan edits not showing, add actual-workout log, new
 branding and loaders

- Keep unstarted workout copies in sync when the plan is edited
- Train week tile follows the plan name instead of the saved workout title
- Progress: per-set bubbles showing the reps and weight actually logged
- New barbell + tick logo, app icons and favicon
- App-open animation, sign-in/PIN backdrop, screen and inline loaders

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
